&lt;p&gt;Download these &lt;a href="https://github.com/alex-anie/linkedin-user-profile/blob/main/src/assets/alexanie.png" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;images&lt;/a&gt; and move them into the assets folder. Next, go to the &lt;code&gt;SideNav&lt;/code&gt; component and type the code below.&lt;/p&gt;

