&lt;h2&gt;


Handling Error in your Application - errorElement
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you click on any of the names on the SideNav, your browser will display an error page. For example, click on the first name khon noma and notice how react-router throws an error page.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;`&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fqsi7kl6rnskoq6kcmipc.webp" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fqsi7kl6rnskoq6kcmipc.webp" alt=" " width="800" height="423"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
`&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;React Router refers to this as &lt;em&gt;Not Found Page or&lt;/em&gt; simply 404. This means the page we are trying to access does not exist or is not specified on the path. To handle this we use &lt;code&gt;errorElement&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With the &lt;code&gt;errorElement&lt;/code&gt;, we can create a page that displays to the users what went wrong when a particular error occurs such as 404, and indicate on the page what action the user should take.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To do this, simply create a new component as &lt;code&gt;src/DisplayError.jsx&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;open the &lt;code&gt;DisplayError.jsx&lt;/code&gt; component and type the code below.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;`js&lt;br&gt;
import { useRouteError, Link } from "react-router-dom"&lt;br&gt;
import imgError from "./assets/exception.jpg";&lt;br&gt;
export default function DisplayError() {&lt;br&gt;
const error = useRouteError();&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;return (&lt;br&gt;
&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;

width: "100vw",&lt;br&gt;
height: "100vh",&lt;br&gt;
position: "relative",&lt;br&gt;
backgroundImage: `url('${imgError}')`,&lt;br&gt;
backgroundPosition: "center center",&lt;br&gt;
backgroundSize: "cover",&lt;br&gt;
backgroundRepeat: "no-repeat",&lt;br&gt;
}}&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;            &amp;lt;div className="absolute top-[8em] left-[40%] "&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-[10em] text-red-600 font-mono font-extrabold"&amp;gt;{error.status}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;div className="absolute bottom-12 left-[35%]"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="font-mono text-center text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-2 rounded-full"&amp;gt;click &amp;lt;Link to="/" className="text-red-600"&amp;gt;here&amp;lt;/Link&amp;gt; to go back to home page&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="font-mono text-center text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-2 rounded-full"&amp;gt;{error.error.message}&amp;lt;/p
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/main&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;p&gt;)&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;`&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note that we are using a hook from react-router called &lt;a href="https://reactrouter.com/en/main/hooks/use-route-error" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;useRouteError&lt;/a&gt; that helps handle the error that occurs during an action.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next, go to the &lt;code&gt;main.jsx&lt;/code&gt; component &lt;code&gt;import&lt;/code&gt; the &lt;code&gt;DisplayError&lt;/code&gt; component and add it to Route.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;`js&lt;br&gt;
import DisplayError from './DisplayError';&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;const router = createBrowserRouter(&lt;br&gt;
createRoutesFromElements(                            👇&lt;br&gt;
} errorElement={}&amp;gt; &lt;br&gt;
)&lt;br&gt;
)&lt;br&gt;
`&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now click any of the names and see what happens. You should see something like this.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fq6wl0n6swqn7brkwm2ko.webp" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fq6wl0n6swqn7brkwm2ko.webp" alt=" " width="800" height="421"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The page above displays an error code of 404 letting the user know that the page can not be found with a text redirecting them to the home page.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Click on the text that says &lt;em&gt;click here to go back to home page&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Implementing Dynamic Segment
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The main idea of our application is to create an app with a list of users generated from LinkedIn. The app contains a list of user names and upon clicking, reviews the details of each user. To achieve this behavior, we need to implement what is referred to as a dynamic segment using the &lt;code&gt;useParams&lt;/code&gt; hook.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the layouts folder, create a component as &lt;code&gt;DisplayContent.jsx&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next, type the code below inside the &lt;code&gt;DisplayContent&lt;/code&gt; component&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;`js&lt;br&gt;
import { BookOpen, MapPin } from "react-feather";&lt;br&gt;
import  linkedinData  from "../apis/mylinkedin.json";&lt;br&gt;
import bgImg from "../assets/colorful.jpg";&lt;br&gt;
import { Link, useParams } from "react-router-dom";&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;export default function DisplayContent() {&lt;br&gt;
const {profileId} = useParams();&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;const profile = linkedinData.find(profile =&amp;gt; profile.id === profileId);

if(!profile){
return &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Profile not found&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
}

return (
&amp;lt;div className="bg-slate-200 "&amp;gt;
{
profile &amp;amp;&amp;amp; (
&amp;lt;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;section className="grid grid-cols-6 gap-8 w-[95%] mt-0 mx-auto overflow-y-scroll h-[100vh] pr-[1em]" id="scrollStyles"&amp;gt;
{/* Header */}
&amp;lt;aside className="col-span-4 rounded-2xl bg-white mt-12 relative"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="w-full h-[10em] bg-blue-700 rounded-t-2xl"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;img src={bgImg} alt="" className="w-full h-full rounded-t-2xl object-left-bottom" /&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="w-[7em] h-[7em] absolute top-[6em] left-12"&amp;gt; 
&amp;lt;img src={profile.avatar} alt="" className="rounded-full w-full h-full border-4 border-white"/&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="py-[4em] px-[2em] grid grid-cols-6 gap-8"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="col-span-2"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;h1 className="text-xl font-bold mb-2"&amp;gt;{profile.name}&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-sm"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;BookOpen size={12} className="inline-block"/&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;em className="not-italic inline-block"&amp;gt;{profile.position}&amp;lt;/em&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-sm mt-4"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;MapPin size={12} className="text-slate-500 inline"/&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;em className="not-italic text-slate-600 inline-block pl-2"&amp;gt;{profile.region}&amp;lt;/em&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;Link to={profile.url} target="_blank" className="text-sm mt-2 block text-blue-700 font-bold hover:text-blue-500"&amp;gt;Connect on Linkedin&amp;lt;/Link&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;div className="col-span-4"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;h2 className="font-bold text-xl mb-4"&amp;gt;
About
&amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-sm"&amp;gt;
{profile.about}
&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;span className="text-sm mt-2 text-blue-700 font-bold  inline-block cursor-default"&amp;gt;following &amp;lt;em className="not-italic text-slate-500 font-normal px-2"&amp;gt;{profile.following}&amp;lt;/em&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;span className="text-sm mt-2 text-blue-700 font-bold  inline-block cursor-default"&amp;gt;followers &amp;lt;em className="not-italic text-slate-500 font-normal px-2"&amp;gt;{profile.followers}&amp;lt;/em&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;span className="text-sm mt-2 text-blue-700 font-bold inline-block cursor-default"&amp;gt;connections &amp;lt;em className="not-italic text-slate-500 font-normal px-2"&amp;gt;{profile.connections}&amp;lt;/em&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/aside&amp;gt;

{/* Experience */}
&amp;lt;aside className="col-span-2 bg-white rounded-2xl mt-12 py-8 px-4"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;h2 className="font-bold text-xl pb-3"&amp;gt;Experience&amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
{
profile.experience.map((ele, index)=&amp;gt; (
&amp;lt;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;section className="flex gap-x-4 mt-8"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="w-[50px] h-[50px] bg-red-600 rounded-xl"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-center font-block text-3xl mt-1"&amp;gt;{ele.title.charAt(0)}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div key={index}&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="font-bold text-sm"&amp;gt;{ele.title}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span className="text-slate-600 text-sm"&amp;gt;Duration&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; &amp;lt;span className="text-sm"&amp;gt;{ele.duration}&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/section&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/&amp;gt;
))
}
&amp;lt;/aside&amp;gt;

{/* Posts */}
&amp;lt;aside className="col-span-4 bg-white rounded-2xl py-8 px-4  h-[fit-content]"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;h2 className="font-bold text-xl pb-3"&amp;gt;Posts&amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="flex gap-4"&amp;gt;
{
profile.posts.map((ele)=&amp;gt;(
&amp;lt;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;Link to={ele.link} className=""&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;img src={ele.img} alt={ele.title} className="rounded-xl" /&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="mt-4 font-bold"&amp;gt;{ele.title}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-slate-500 my-2"&amp;gt;{ele.attribution}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-sm"&amp;gt;{ele.created_at}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/Link&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/&amp;gt;
))
}
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/aside&amp;gt;

{/* Education */}
&amp;lt;aside className="col-span-2 bg-white rounded-2xl py-8 px-4 mb-[8em] h-[fit-content]"&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;h2 className="font-bold text-xl pb-3"&amp;gt;Education&amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
{
profile.education.map((ele)=&amp;gt;(
&amp;lt;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="flex"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div className="w-[50px] h-[50px] bg-blue-600 rounded-xl text-white"&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;p className="text-center font-block text-3xl mt-1"&amp;gt;{ele.title.charAt(0)}&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;

